{"id":"446dc4361d624e0f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-epsilon-0.md","title":"Epsilon 0","display":"df-epsilon-0 — Epsilon 0","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-epsilon-0","aliases":["72-df-epsilon-0"],"display":"df-epsilon-0 — Epsilon 0","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214/PDF222–226; local fixed-point proof","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-epsilon-0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-epsilon-0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-0 — Epsilon 0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214/PDF222–226; local fixed-point proof"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 是最小无限序数，指数为序数指数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_n\">\\(\\omega_n\\)</span> 由自然数递归定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 表示序数真类，仅用于元语言。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\omega_{n+1}:=\\omega^{\\omega_n},\\qquad\\varepsilon_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega_n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\omega_{n+1}:=\\omega^{\\omega_n},\\qquad\\varepsilon_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega_n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>序列严格递增。指数的极限连续性给ω<sup>{supωn}=supω</sup>{ωn}=supωn；任一正不动点δ通过n归纳满足ωn≤δ，故该上确界是最小正不动点。证明仅在ZFC元理论中进行，不是PA内部的统一良基性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\omega_{n+1}:=\\omega^{\\omega_n},\\qquad\\varepsilon_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega_n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:0<\\alpha\\land\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1131,"backlinks":[{"id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"23689fb4bbf5ac96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_h$ 与 $\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]；$E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j<k}\\in\\mathcal E_h$。$c\\in\\omega$，c≥2；$\\varepsilon_0$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-0]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-epsilon-0|df-epsilon-0 — Epsilon 0]]"},{"id":"8f89d4e14473676b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}